function progressPreview(){return `<div class="onboarding-progress-preview" aria-label="Example Level Up progress. Preview data only."><div class="onboarding-preview-head"><div><span>EXAMPLE PROGRESS</span><strong>Momentum is building</strong></div><b>12 WEEKS</b></div><div class="onboarding-preview-grid"><article><div class="onboarding-preview-label"><span>Estimated 1RM</span><strong>+16%</strong></div><b>215 <small>lb</small></b><svg viewBox="0 0 164 66" role="img" aria-label="Example estimated one rep max increasing"><path class="preview-gridline" d="M2 54H162M2 32H162M2 10H162"/><path class="preview-area" d="M3 53 C25 52 34 48 51 47 S81 37 98 38 S126 27 161 13 L161 64 L3 64Z"/><path class="preview-line" pathLength="1" d="M3 53 C25 52 34 48 51 47 S81 37 98 38 S126 27 161 13"/><circle cx="161" cy="13" r="4"/></svg></article><article><div class="onboarding-preview-label"><span>Weight trend</span><strong>On track</strong></div><b>181.4 <small>lb</small></b><svg viewBox="0 0 164 66" role="img" aria-label="Example body-weight trend"><path class="preview-gridline" d="M2 54H162M2 32H162M2 10H162"/><path class="preview-daily" d="M3 51 L19 42 L35 47 L51 34 L67 38 L83 30 L99 34 L115 22 L131 27 L147 17 L161 20"/><path class="preview-trend" pathLength="1" d="M3 48 C36 44 55 40 82 34 S127 24 161 19"/><circle cx="161" cy="19" r="4"/></svg></article></div><p>Preview data shows how Level Up turns workouts and weigh-ins into useful trends.</p></div>`}
