function valid(key){if(key==="goal")return!!answers.primaryGoal;if(key==="experience")return!!answers.experience;if(key==="schedule")return[2,3,4,5,6].includes(Number(answers.days))&&[30,45,60,75,90].includes(Number(answers.duration))&&TRAINING_SETUPS.some(([v])=>v===answers.trainingSetup);if(key==="profile"){const age=Number(answers.age),mh=answers.unitPreferences.length==="cm",mw=answers.unitPreferences.bodyWeight==="kg",ft=Number(answers.heightFeet),inch=Number(answers.heightInches),cm=Number(answers.heightCm),w=Number(mw?answers.weightKg:answers.weightLb),height=mh?cm>=90&&cm<=250:ft>=3&&ft<=8&&inch>=0&&inch<=11;return age>=18&&age<=100&&["male","female"].includes(answers.sex)&&height&&w>0}if(key==="nutrition-choice")return typeof answers.trackNutrition==="boolean";if(key==="nutrition-activity")return Boolean(ACTIVITY_LEVELS[answers.nutritionActivity]);if(key==="nutrition-goal")return Boolean(GOAL_PRESETS[answers.nutritionGoalId]&&nutritionPreview());if(key==="nutrition-mode")return answers.nutritionMode==="manual"||answers.nutritionMode==="coach";if(key==="appearance")return APPEARANCE_THEMES.some(t=>t.id===answers.theme);if(key==="acquisition")return ACQUISITION_SOURCES.some(([source])=>source===answers.acquisitionSource);return true}
